 back  in his home state of new jersey  as of right now joey diaz's show the  church of what's happening now  is over his sidekick lee syat has left  los angeles as well  i think he said he was moving to  milwaukee for a little while then moving  back to boston  so even when joey diaz does bring the  show back  it won't be the same as it was now i  know that some fans of the church do not  like lee  but i don't agree with that at all i  think he's actually a lovable guy  and whether you like him or not he was a  part of the show and now he's gone as  well  now you have to wonder what joey diaz's  show will look like whenever he brings  it back  i'm sure joey will still have great  stories to tell like he always does  but will he be able to get people to fly  to new jersey to be on the show the days  of us seeing all the la comedians  joining their friends on their shows  will be far  and few in between the fighter and the  kid is another show that is almost  unrecognizable as of right now brendan  shaw is still hosting the show but it  doesn't look like brian callan will be  coming back  ever for those of you that don't know  brian callan is one of joe rogan's best  friends  they've been friends ever since the 90s  and in fact  joe rogan has even called brian his  brother as of right now  brian callan is in some hot water ever  since some recent accusations have come  out against him  obviously i wasn't there so i don't know  what happened between them  all i know is this does not look good  for brian  ever since those allegations came out he  hasn't been seen on the fighter in the  kid  or joe rogan's show as far as i know he  has been dropped by everyone  his agent let him go his manager let him  go and so on and so forth  now this is only a guess but i think he  hasn't been on the fighter on the kid  for a few different reasons  for one the comment section would  obviously eat him alive  they already have been even when he's  not on the show but i'm sure they would  lose all their sponsors as well  brian and brendan tried to make a new  show called the fighter in the ranks  which was a patreon exclusive but that  did not last very long either  i can only assume brendan's agent  manager lawyer or whoever told him it  might not be a good idea to host a show  with brian callen right now  so as you can see for one reason or  another some of joe rogan's closest  friends have already stopped creating  shows  before he even left los angeles as of  right now  the church of what's happening now is  over the fighter and the kit is over  now it's just the former fighter and  some random comedian  another well-known la comedian and  podcaster crystalia  has been silent for several months as  well he has also had many different  allegations come out against him  he hasn't uploaded anything or been seen  on anyone's show since  june or early july now if brian or dalia  are guilty of those accusations  then they deserve to be held accountable  but until i have all the facts i will  reserve  my judgment for a later day i do however  wonder if any of this influenced joe  rogan's decision to leave la  not only has comedy been cancelled in  the city but a lot of the comedians he  surrounds himself with are getting  cancelled as well  even if this has nothing to do with him  leaving he has to be thinking everything  is collapsing around him in los  angeles theo vaughn is another one from  this circle of friends who is leaving  the city  as far as i know he will be moving to  nashville very soon  now that all these comedians are moving  away from each other this will  definitely have an effect on all their  shows  they will no longer have access to the  same caliber of people they once had  the comedy store in los angeles will  also suffer because of this  before kovan they had an insane lineup  almost every single night  but now a lot of their headliners will  be spread out across the united states  like i said i'm sure they will still be  able to go on each other's shows every  now and then  but it will not be the same i may be  speaking for myself here but i am not a  fan of the shows they do over zoom  or skype or whatever it is they use it  doesn't have the same feeling it does  when they're in the same room together  there is a bit of a disconnect when they  aren't able to feed off each other's  energy  like they normally do now as i'm writing  some of this down  joey diaz ended his show last night and  it was kind of sad to see that show as  we know it come to an end  i will be very interested in seeing how  things unfold from here on out  i hope we do get some more insight into  what is actually happening behind the  scenes because  although i do believe covet is one of  the main reasons they are all leaving la  i don't think it's the only reason maybe  they're all starting to feel like the  walls are closing in around them  who knows regardless of what led to this  it does appear to be the end of an era  my friends i will be looking forward to  seeing who joe rogan has on his show  now that he will be in texas like i said  before  i am just a fan who wanted to give their  thoughts on some of the recent  developments  if you're a fan as well let me know what  you think down below  i would love to hear what you have to  say anyways i want to thank everyone for  watching the video  i really appreciate that and i hope all  of you have a great day  i will see you in the next video bye

